@page "/PayItForward"

<PageTitle>Pay it Forward - Derby Dash</PageTitle>

<div class="pay-it-forward-container">
    <div class="pay-it-forward-header">
        <h1>Share the Math Success with Friends</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">It's Easy!</p>
    </div>

    <div class="intro-section">
        <p>Love how your kids are learning math?</p>
        <p>Help your friends and family discover the difference!</p>
        <p>Our referral program makes it simple and rewarding for everyone.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="how-it-works">
        <h2>Here's how it works:</h2>
        
        <div class="steps-container">
            <div class="step-card">
                <div class="step-number">1</div>
                <div class="step-icon"><i class="fas fa-paper-plane"></i></div>
                <h3>Send an Invitation</h3>
                <p>Invite your friends or relatives to try our math program using your unique referral link or code.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="step-card">
                <div class="step-number">2</div>
                <div class="step-icon"><i class="fas fa-gift"></i></div>
                <h3>Your Friend Gets a Discount</h3>
                <p>When your friend signs up using your invitation, they'll get</p> 
                <p>3 months free</p>
                <p>and</p> 
                <p>a $5 credit toward their first subscription.</p>
                <p>No strings attached!</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="step-card">
                <div class="step-number">3</div>
                <div class="step-icon"><i class="fas fa-award"></i></div>
                <h3>You Earn Rewards</h3>
                <p>For every friend who subscribes, you'll earn a $5 credit to use toward your next subscription. If your friend refers someone else, you'll get an extra $2.50 credit as a thank-you for helping our community grow!</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="step-card">
                <div class="step-number">4</div>
                <div class="step-icon"><i class="fas fa-heart"></i></div>
                <h3>Share Extra Generosity</h3>
                <p>If you have existing rewards, you can choose to forward an extra $10 credit to a friend—making it even easier for them to get started! So they get $15 off the list price. This would be in lieu of you getting the $5 credit, but you do still get extra credit for everyone they refer.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="summary">
            <p>It's that easy! Invite as many friends as you like, enjoy your rewards, and help other families experience math success.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="benefits-section">
        <h2>Why You'll Love It:</h2>
        <ul class="benefits-list">
            <li>
                <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
                <span><strong>Easy to Use:</strong> Just share your link—no complicated steps or decisions.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
                <span><strong>Everyone Wins:</strong> Your friends save, and you earn credits every time someone joins.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
                <span><strong>Unlimited Sharing:</strong> There's no limit to how many friends you can invite or how many credits you can earn!</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
                <span><strong>No Confusion:</strong> Credits are automatically applied to your next subscription payment.</span>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="cta-section">
        <h2>Ready to share the math magic?</h2>
        <p>Start inviting friends today and watch your rewards—and your community—grow!</p>
        <button class="share-button">
            <i class="fas fa-share-alt"></i> Share Now
        </button>
    </div>
</div>

